        "original_id": "67e09137-77fb-5fe9-a427-5500885d480b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sandra Bullock, Bill Pullman, Peter Gallagher, Peter Boyle, Glynis Johns, Jack Warden, Monica Keena\n- Films: While You Were Sleeping, The Devil's Advocate\n- Roles: Lucy, Jack, Peter, Lilli Hoffman\n- Organizations: Chicago Transit Authority\n\nFacts:\n- Bill Pullman was born on December 17, 1953, and he is an American actor.\n- In the 1995 film While You Were Sleeping, Sandra Bullock starred as Lucy, a Chicago Transit Authority token collector.\n- In the 1995 film While You Were Sleeping, Bill Pullman played Jack, the brother of the man whose life is saved.\n- In the 1995 film While You Were Sleeping, Peter Gallagher played Peter, the man who is saved.\n- In the 1995 film While You Were Sleeping, Peter Boyle and Glynis Johns played members of Peter's family, and Jack Warden played a longtime family friend and neighbor.\n- Monica Keena made her film debut in While You Were Sleeping in 1995.\n- Monica Keena had a supporting role in The Devil's Advocate in 1997.\n- In 1997, Monica Keena had a lead role as Lilli Hoffman in a film title that is not provided in this chunk.",
